<title>UK: Goldman Sachs ups seven-year FRN to $400 million.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs ups seven-year FRN to $400 million.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following callable floating-rate issue has been increased by $100 million to $400 million, lead manager Goldman Sachs International said on Friday</p>
<p> BORROWER   GOLDMAN SACHS LP</p>
<p> AMT	  $400 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	*JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 B.P.  PAY DATE    02.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  ISS PRICE  99.89     FULL FEES   0.30</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  REOFFER    99.89</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.175     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE AT PAR FROM JUN.2000.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
